      en: ["Managed by the state-owned SCH hydrocarbon company", "Strategic storage for diesel, gasoline, and kerosene", "Located within the Mutsamudu port industrial zone", "Directly supplies the island's main thermal power grid", "Safety protocols were significantly upgraded after 2010", "Primary distribution point for the entire Anjouan region"],
